<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Buy Better Finds"
  description="Privacy information for visitors to Buy Better Finds."
>
  <article class="article">
    <div class="eyebrow">Privacy</div>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">This Privacy Policy explains how Buy Better Finds handles information when you visit this website.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>Buy Better Finds does not require you to create an account to browse the website. If you contact us, information you voluntarily provide—such as your name, email address, and message—may be used to respond to your inquiry.</p>

    <h2>Automatically collected information</h2>
    <p>Like most websites, our hosting provider and other technical services may process basic information needed to deliver and secure the website, such as IP address, browser type, device information, requested pages, and approximate usage information. We use such information only as reasonably necessary to operate, secure, maintain, and improve the site.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
    <p>Buy Better Finds may use cookies or similar technologies provided by the website, hosting provider, analytics services, or affiliate partners. Affiliate retailers may also use cookies or other tracking technologies after you follow an affiliate link so that qualifying referrals can be attributed correctly.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>Buy Better Finds participates or may participate in affiliate marketing programs. When you follow an affiliate link, the applicable retailer or affiliate network may receive information about the referral and may set or recognize cookies according to its own privacy policy.</p>

    <h2>Amazon</h2>
    <p>If Buy Better Finds participates in the Amazon Associates Program, Amazon may collect information and use cookies or similar technologies in connection with visits to Amazon resulting from our qualifying links. Amazon's own privacy policy and terms govern information collected on Amazon.</p>

    <h2>Third-party websites</h2>
    <p>Our website may link to manufacturers, retailers, affiliate networks, and other third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices, content, security, or policies of those third parties. Review the privacy policy of any third-party website you visit.</p>

    <h2>Data retention and security</h2>
    <p>We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it was collected, legal obligations, dispute resolution, and legitimate business needs. We use reasonable measures to protect information, but no internet transmission or storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This website is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can limit cookies through your browser settings. Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have additional privacy rights regarding personal information. Requests may be directed through our <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy as the website, services, or legal requirements change. The updated version will be posted on this page.</p>

    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 11, 2026</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
